#
# Generated by Session 245 (the EIGHTH trim). Re-runnable, read-only, exits non-zero on failure.
#
#   bash <this>              prove the eighth trim was lossless AND landed where it was declared
#   bash <this> --self-test  prove this proof can FAIL (95 mutants; exit 2 if any survives)
#
# Descended from Session 242's SESSION_NOTES-S238-through-S236.md.verify.sh, itself descended from
# Session 239's, Session 235's, Session 231's, Session 228's, Session 224's and Session 222's — read
# those for the rationale behind L0-L3, L4, L5-L7, L8-L9, L10-L11, L12 and L13. Shards are
# WRITE-ONCE: this proof pins ITS OWN cut key and does not re-prove the earlier shards' cuts.
# Run all eight.
#
