# adversarial review caught the second. A tally nobody derives is the thing this file is about.)
#
# An assertion is a handful of separate `if`s; neutering the whole function cannot tell you that one
# of those `if`s has never fired. So the arms must be neutered one at a time as well.
#
# *** THE PER-ARM SWEEP IS OUTSTANDING FOR THIS PROOF, AND THAT IS STATED HERE RATHER THAN IMPLIED.
# *** It was run to completion twice during this session, but both runs describe REVISIONS THAT NO
